{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"agent_message","text":"The read path has protections worth preserving: quorum-confirmed reads wait for a current-term commit, and callers must distinguish request contexts. I’m now tracing leader removal, where the singleton read shortcut may interact with a leader that remains active after leaving the voter set.\n"}}
